  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Pulse Wear designed by the the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@fashionpulse\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@fashionpulse\" rel=\"noopener\">Fashion Pulse</a>&nbsp;team. We were inspired by the style of luxury 90's. All products are made of the highest quality materials.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Founded by the creative minds at Fashion Pulse, Pulse Wear isn't just a brand; it's a celebration of the vibrant styles that defined an entire decade. Our designs pay homage to the world's most iconic cities. From the vibes of Courchevel to the chic elegance of Monaco, we offer you a curated selection that transcends borders.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">What sets Pulse Wear apart is our unwavering commitment to quality. We understand that the right fabric can make all the difference, so we use only the finest materials to craft each piece in our collection. Our dedication to excellence ensures that when you slip into Pulse Wear, you're not just wearing a garment; you're embodying a fusion of style, comfort, and durability.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">As you explore our online store, you'll discover a treasure trove of clothing that captures the essence of the 90s while seamlessly blending with the contemporary fashion landscape. Join us on this journey through time and style. Pulse Wear is more than just a brand, we believe that new is the well forgotten old.</span></p>",
